DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\, Member Mixer\nPrice: $100.00 per pe
 rson\nAvailability: 1 spot left\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent URL: https:/
 /members.thequinhouse.com/events/208802\n\nJoin us for an intimate evening
  of thoughtful conversation\, new connections\, and exceptional dining\, h
 osted in part by The ’Quin House’s Art Curator\, Kate Chertavian. Brin
 ging her expertise and passion for the arts to the table\, Kate will help 
 guide conversations that may explore everything from The ’Quin’s own a
 rt collection to the broader world of art and culture\, inviting fresh per
 spectives and meaningful exchanges along the way.\n\nOver a beautifully cu
 rated three-course dinner with expertly paired wines\, members will have t
 he opportunity to share stories\, exchange ideas\, and get to know one ano
 ther beyond the everyday. Settle in for an evening where engaging dialogue
 \, great food\, and good company come together.\n\n*Tickets are $100 per p
 erson\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancellations within
  72 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will be charged in full. P
 lease inform us of any dietary needs or restrictions by emailing happening
 s@thequin.com at least 72 hours before dinner service.
