DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: $475.00 per person\nAvailabili
 ty: 1 spot left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhous
 e.com/events/207106\n\nAnother night of Celtics basketball awaits at TD Ga
 rden. Join fellow members in The ’Quin Suite (#524) as the Celtics face 
 off against the Orlando Magic for an exciting regular-season matchup.\n\
 nAll suite ticket options include incredible views of the on-court action 
 and light gameday bites and an assortment of refreshments including wine\
 , beer and seltzer. Are you game?\n\n*A pair of 'Quin suite seats is avail
 able for $995 total ($497.50 per ticket). Individual suite tickets are av
 ailable for bar stool / standing access only\, offered at a reduced price 
 of $475 per ticket. Suite tickets are non-refundable and are non-transfer
