SUMMARY:Dessert Trolley 
LOCATION:The Reading Room
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avai
 lable\nTime: 7 PM – 10 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/e
 vents/209683\n\nEnd the evening with a nightcap in The Reading Room\, wher
 e The ’Quin’s pastry team presents a beautifully curated dessert troll
 ey in celebration of Hispanic Heritage Month—an elegant showcase of belo
 ved sweets and flavors inspired by traditions from across Latin America.\n
 \nDiscover an assortment of indulgent treats\, from silky flan and delicat
 e alfajores to buttery Mexican wedding cookies\, alongside a rotating sele
 ction of confections thoughtfully crafted for the occasion. Familiar flavo
 rs and time-honored favorites come together with The ’Quin’s signature
  touch\, offering something tempting with every pass of the cart.\n\nWith 
 tableside service and a touch of ceremony\, it’s a sweet celebration of 
 heritage\, tradition\, and the simple pleasure of ending the evening with 
 dessert.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/209683
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
