BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-211490@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20261120T143000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T160000
SUMMARY:‘Quin Chat: Inside the Exhibition with Alexandre Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent U
 RL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/211490\n\nJoin us in The Readi
 ng Room for a ’Quin Chat exploring the artists\, influences\, and connec
 tions behind our fall exhibition. Phil Alexandre\, President & Director of
  Alexandre Gallery\, joins artist Tessa Greene O’Brien for a conversatio
 n moderated by The ’Quin’s art collection curator\, Kate Chertavian\, 
 offering fresh perspectives on the works on view throughout the ’House.\
 n\nSpanning the Lobby\, Grand Staircase\, and Reading Room\, the exhibitio
 n features 25 works on loan through Alexandre Gallery\, including painting
 s by Lois Dodd\, Loren MacIver\, Pat Adams\, Tessa Greene O’Brien\, Lisa
  Sanditz\, Meghan Brady and Emily Nelligan. Together\, we will explore how
  these artists translate the world around them through distinct approaches
  to color\, form\, landscape\, and abstraction - and consider the shared i
 nfluences and individual visions that connect their work across generation
 s.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members\, plus one gu
 est. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served. Cancellat
 ions made within 24 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will resul
 t in a $25 charge.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/211490
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
