SUMMARY:'Venture: European Holiday Markets
LOCATION:Offsite: Strasbourg\, Nuremberg\, Vienna\, and Munich
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Venture - Travel\nPrice: $10150.00 per person\nAva
 ilability: 1 spot left\nStatus: Available\nTime: 3 PM – 12 PM\nEvent URL
 : https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/200238\n\nThis December\, trade 
 the usual holiday routine for a ‘Venture through the heart of Europe dur
 ing its most magical season. Wander Strasbourg’s storybook streets\, exp
 erience Nuremberg’s legendary Christkindlesmarkt\, revel in the grandeur
  of Vienna\, and savor a final taste of Bavaria in Munich. With exceptiona
 l dining\, luxury accommodations\, private transportation\, and time to di
 scover each destination at leisure\, every detail has been thoughtfully co
 nsidered. \n\nBegin in the heart of Alsace\, with two days to wander Stra
 sbourg’s celebrated holiday markets\, half-timbered streets\, artisan st
 alls\, and historic landmarks\, gathering over Alsatian fare in centuries-
 old settings along the way. From there\, journey east to Nuremberg and the
  legendary Christkindlesmarkt\, one of the world’s oldest holiday market
 s\, with time to explore the medieval Old Town\, Imperial Castle\, and sta
 lls beneath the Frauenkirche before an evening of Franconian specialties.\
 n\nThe journey continues to Vienna\, where imperial landmarks\, elegant bo
 ulevards\, and enchanting holiday markets set the scene for an afternoon i
 n one of Europe’s grandest capitals. Finally\, Bavaria provides a fittin
 g finale in Munich. Wander from Marienplatz to the Viktualienmarkt\, disco
 ver neighborhood markets and local boutiques\, and savor one last taste of
  the season before raising a glass together over a farewell dinner overloo
 king the National Theatre. An extraordinary journey through the traditions
 \, flavors\, and unmistakable magic of the European holiday season awaits.
 \n\nSingle Occupancy | $6\,950\n\nDouble Occupancy | $10\,150\n\n*Reservat
 ions are non-refundable and non-transferable in order to guarantee accomm
 odations during the high season. Payment is due in full at the time of boo
 king. To ensure the best possible experience for all attendees\, we kindl
 y ask that members inform us in advance of any physical limitations\, mobi
 lity considerations\, or accessibility needs we should be aware of. All me
 mbers will also be asked to sign The 'Quin's standard liability agreement 
 in advance of travel and minimum interest must be met to ensure the trip w
 ill proceed as planned.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/200238
CATEGORIES:‘Venture - Travel
END:VEVENT
