 nPrice: $65.00 per person\nAvailability: 14 spots left\nStatus: Available\
 nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/210997\n\nMake your Sa
 turday a little more serendipitous with a leisurely brunch hosted by the S
 enior Director of The ’Quin Impact Fund\, Michelle Perez. Gather in Luna
 sol for an afternoon centered around good food\, easy conversation\, and a
  shared spirit of giving\, connecting with fellow members while celebratin
 g the generosity of our community.\n\nSettle in over a seasonal selection 
 of chef-crafted entrées\, accompanied by family-style favorites and class
 ic brunch cocktails\, including mimosas and Bloody Marys. In the spirit of
  the season\, members are encouraged to bring a gift for Wonderfund\, a th
 oughtful way to share a little joy beyond the ’House.\n\nSpend your Satu
 rday unhurried\, social\, and in good company\, with a little serendipity 
 and generosity at the table.\n\n*Tickets are $65 per person\, plus tax\, a
 nd are reserved for members only. Cancellations within 72 hours of the eve
