 e.com/events/176004\n\nJoin The ’Quin House Director of Membership\, Lis
 a Flores\, for an intimate evening centered around thoughtful conversation
 \, new connections\, and exceptional dining. Over a beautifully curated th
 ree-course dinner with expertly paired wines\, members will be invited to 
 engage in guided conversation designed to spark meaningful exchanges and b
 ring new perspectives to the table.\n\nSettle in\, share stories\, and get
  to know fellow members beyond the everyday\, all while enjoying an evenin
 g where great food\, engaging dialogue\, and good company come together.\n
