 tatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/2119
 42\n\nKate Chertavian Fine Art's curation of the 'Quin sought to broaden t
 he Algonquin Club's historic collection by introducing a talented group of
  artists who have local\, national\, and international stories and backgro
 unds. Please join 'Quin House curator Kate Chertavian for an art tour focu
 sed on the curatorial process of building the 'Quin's collection. The disc
 ussion will include insights into the collaborative process of selection\,
  placement\, and installation of these artworks which have come to define 
 the spirit of the club. The tour will begin in the Lobby and continue thro
 ugh the Grand Staircase and Reading Room\, highlighting key works and the 
 stories behind them. \n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for mem
 bers\, plus one guest. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at lea
 st 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
